{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is within reach, pick it up, process it, finally place it down, if not, navigate to/find it.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectDown    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = NavigateToFindObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjectOfType    />\"",
    "BT": {
